## Key Architecture Decisions

| Decision | Reason |
|----------|--------|
| `password: select: false` | Password never returned in any query unless explicitly `.select("+password")` |
| Hash only in `pre("save")` | Avoids double-hashing; `isModified("password")` guard ensures it only runs when password changes |
| Hashed reset token in DB | Raw token travels via email; stored hash can't be reverse-engineered if DB is breached |
| `forgotPassword` returns 200 for unknown emails | Prevents **email enumeration attacks** |
| `authorize(...roles)` factory | Composable RBAC — `protect, authorize("admin")` or `protect, authorize("admin","restaurantOwner")` |

